   "kop": "Bezittelijke voornaamwoorden",
   "blokken": [
    {
     "soort": "tekst",
     "html": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;text-align:left;\"><tr><th style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;background:rgba(47,93,80,.09);padding:6px 9px;color:#234539;font-weight:600;text-align:left;\">Persoon</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;background:rgba(47,93,80,.09);padding:6px 9px;color:#234539;font-weight:600;text-align:left;\">Bezit</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;background:rgba(47,93,80,.09);padding:6px 9px;color:#234539;font-weight:600;text-align:left;\">Voorbeeld</th></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">ich</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">mein</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">mein Bruder, meine Schwester</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">du</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">dein</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">dein Hund</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">er / es</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">sein</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">sein Fahrrad</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">sie</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">ihr</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">ihre Mutter</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">wir</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">unser</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">unser Haus</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">ihr</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">euer</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">eure Lehrerin</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">sie / Sie</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">ihr / Ihr</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">Ihr Name, bitte?</td></tr></table>"
    },
    {
     "soort": "kader",
     "html": "Een bezittelijk voornaamwoord krijgt dezelfde uitgangen als <em>ein</em>: <em>meine</em> bij een vrouwelijk woord en in het meervoud, <em>meinen</em> in de Akkusativ mannelijk: <em>Ich besuche meinen Opa.</em>"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "kop": "Aanwijzend en vragend",
   "blokken": [
    {
     "soort": "tekst",
     "html": "<em>dieser, diese, dieses</em> (deze, dit) volgt de uitgangen van <em>der, die, das</em>: <em>Dieser Pullover ist schön. Ich nehme diesen Pullover.</em>"
    },
    {
     "soort": "tekst",
     "html": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;text-align:left;\"><tr><th style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;background:rgba(47,93,80,.09);padding:6px 9px;color:#234539;font-weight:600;text-align:left;\">Vraagwoord</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;background:rgba(47,93,80,.09);padding:6px 9px;color:#234539;font-weight:600;text-align:left;\">Betekenis</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;background:rgba(47,93,80,.09);padding:6px 9px;color:#234539;font-weight:600;text-align:left;\">Voorbeeld</th></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">wer?</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">wie? (onderwerp)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">Wer kommt mit?</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">wen?</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">wie? (lijdend voorwerp)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">Wen besuchst du?</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">wem?</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">aan wie?</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">Wem gehört das Buch?</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">was?</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">wat?</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">Was machst du?</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">wo? woher? wohin?</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">waar? waarvandaan? waarheen?</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">Woher kommst du?</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">welcher, welche, welches?</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">welk(e)?</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">Welche Farbe magst du?</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">warum? wann? wie?</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">waarom? wanneer? hoe?</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">Wie alt bist du?</td></tr></table>"
    },
    {
     "soort": "kader",
     "html": "<strong>Valse vrienden:</strong> <em>wer</em> is wie, <em>wie</em> is hoe, <em>wo</em> is waar."
    },
    {
     "soort": "kader",
     "html": "<p><strong>Luidop oefenen.</strong> Stel aan iemand thuis vijf vragen met telkens een ander vraagwoord.</p>"
    }
   ]
